#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/artPatterns.ts:68
msgid "A four-span bridge connects upper and lower chords with continuous triangular supports, clearly showing connections between vertical members and diagonal braces."
msgstr "四跨桥梁以连续三角支撑连接上下弦杆，竖杆与斜撑的连接清晰可辨。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/carbonLattices.ts:114
msgid "A honeycomb sheet closes circumferentially into a (6,0) zigzag tube; four rows of two sublattices contain 48 atoms and 60 bonds, with two open ends and no caps."
msgstr "蜂窝片层沿周向闭合为 (6,0) 锯齿型管，四排二子格共 48 个原子、60 条键；两端开口，无端帽。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/penrose.ts:79
msgid "A Penrose P3 sun seed undergoes two golden-ratio subdivisions of Robinson triangles, forming a finite patch of 20 complete rhombi. Ideal irrational coordinates are first uniformly approximated to one millionth and then rotated exactly to a fixed view; shared edges are entered only once."
msgstr "彭罗斯 P3 太阳种子经两次 Robinson 三角形黄金分割细分，配成 20 块完整菱形的有限片段。理想无理坐标先统一近似到百万分之一，再精确旋转至固定视角；共享边只输入一次。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/fullerene.ts:48
msgid "A perspective projection of the complete truncated-icosahedral cage retains all 60 atoms and 90 connections. The golden ratio is approximated by 1618/1000; interior crossings in the image are not chemical bond connections."
msgstr "完整截角二十面体球笼的透视投影，保留全部 60 个原子与 90 条连接。黄金比例以 1618/1000 近似；图中内部穿越不代表化学键连接。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:30
msgid "A shorter diagonal segment is entirely contained in another segment."
msgstr "较短斜线段完整包含在另一条线段内。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:25
msgid "A third segment starts at (1/2, 1/2), intersecting both diagonals at once."
msgstr "第三条线从 (1/2, 1/2) 出发，与两条对角线同时相交。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:35
msgid "A third, shorter segment neither splits nor shortens the complete overlap of the first two inputs."
msgstr "第三条短线段不会切碎或缩短前两个输入的完整重叠。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:36
msgid "A vertical segment crosses reversed duplicate segments; a diagonal endpoint shares the interior crossing, while coincident and boundary points retain their own pairs."
msgstr "反向重复线段被竖线穿过；斜线端点与内部交叉同点，重合点及边界点仍保留各自配对。"

