#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:31
msgid "All three inputs cover y = 0, x ∈ [0, 4]; input direction does not change the closed set. S0 × S1, S0 × S2, and S1 × S2 all intersect over (0, 0) → (4, 0): 3 interval pairs and no point pairs."
msgstr "三个输入都覆盖 y = 0、x ∈ [0, 4]，输入方向不改变闭集。S0 × S1、S0 × S2、S1 × S2 的交集均为 (0, 0) → (4, 0)，共 3 个区间配对，没有点类型配对。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:35
msgid "All three lie on y = 0. S0 × S1 intersects over (0, 0) → (6, 0); both S0 × S2 and S1 × S2 intersect over (2, 0) → (3, 0). There are 3 pairs, and the endpoints of S2 do not split the first complete interval."
msgstr "三者都在 y = 0 上。S0 × S1 的交集为 (0, 0) → (6, 0)；S0 × S2 与 S1 × S2 均为 (2, 0) → (3, 0)。共 3 对，S2 的端点不切碎前一完整区间。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:17
msgid "An endpoint of a vertical segment lies inside a horizontal segment."
msgstr "竖直线段的端点落在水平线段内部。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:22
msgid "At one event position, observe all six pairs being recorded, the ending segment leaving, the starting segment entering, and the segments passing through reordering."
msgstr "在一个事件位置看完六个配对的记录、结束者退出、开始者加入与穿过者换序。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:22
msgid "At the origin, S0 and S1 cross in their interiors, S2 ends, and S3 starts."
msgstr "原点同时发生 S0、S1 内部交叉、S2 结束和 S3 开始。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:32
msgid "At x = 1/2, the intersection of y ranges [−1/3, 5/3] and [1/3, 7/3] is [1/3, 5/3]. The only pair intersects over (1/2, 1/3) → (1/2, 5/3); S0 ends at the upper boundary while S1 continues to 7/3."
msgstr "x = 1/2 上，y 范围 [−1/3, 5/3] 与 [1/3, 7/3] 的交集是 [1/3, 5/3]。唯一配对为 (1/2, 1/3) → (1/2, 5/3)，S0 在止界结束，S1 继续至 7/3。"

