#: src/cases/presets.ts:30
msgid "Both satisfy y = x, and the common range of x intervals [0, 4] and [1, 3] is [1, 3]. The only pair intersects over (1, 1) → (3, 3); S0 continues after the shorter member S1 ends."
msgstr "两者均满足 y = x，x 范围 [0, 4] 与 [1, 3] 的公共范围是 [1, 3]。唯一配对交集为 (1, 1) → (3, 3)，短成员 S1 结束后 S0 继续。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:29
msgid "Both segments lie on y = 0. S0 has x ∈ [0, 4] and S1 has x ∈ [2, 6]; their common range is [max(0, 2), min(4, 6)] = [2, 4], so the intersection is the closed interval (2, 0) → (4, 0), including both endpoints and every point between them."
msgstr "两条线段都在 y = 0 上。S0 的 x ∈ [0, 4]，S1 的 x ∈ [2, 6]；公共范围为 [max(0, 2), min(4, 6)] = [2, 4]，所以交集是 (2, 0) → (4, 0) 的闭区间，包含两端及其间全部点。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:33
msgid "Both segments satisfy y = x, and their x ranges [0, 2] and [2, 4] share only 2. Their only intersection is the included endpoint (2, 2), with no nonzero-length overlap."
msgstr "两条线段都满足 y = x，x 范围 [0, 2] 与 [2, 4] 仅共享 2，所以唯一交集是闭端点 (2, 2)，没有非零长度重叠。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/presets.ts:34
msgid "Both segments satisfy y = x, but their x ranges [0, 1] and [2, 4] are separated by a gap, so their common range is empty."
msgstr "两条线段均满足 y = x，但 x 范围 [0, 1] 与 [2, 4] 之间存在间隙，公共范围为空。"

