msgstr "水平线段的完整交集为 [2, 4]。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/carbonLattices.ts:105
msgid "The four tetrahedral centers of one conventional unit cell and all their nearest neighbors form 14 atoms and 16 bonds; outer connections are truncated at the finite cluster boundary."
msgstr "一个常规晶胞的四个四面体中心及其全部近邻，共 14 个原子、16 条键；外围连接在有限簇边界截断。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/artPatterns.ts:99
msgid "The segment for parameter t has endpoints (3(t − 6), −6t) and (3(t + 6), 6t). Strings with parameters t and u intersect at (3(t + u), tu), within both segments; for example, S5 × S7 intersects at (0, −1) and S6 × S7 at (3, 0). The continuous line family is tangent to y = x²/36 at (6t, t²), so the finite arrangement outlines its envelope; 13 strings produce 78 distinct intersection positions."
msgstr "参数 t 的线段端点为 (3(t − 6), −6t) 与 (3(t + 6), 6t)。参数 t、u 的两弦交于 (3(t + u), tu)，在线段范围内；例如 S5 × S7 为 (0, −1)，S6 × S7 为 (3, 0)。连续直线族与 y = x²/36 在 (6t, t²) 相切，因此有限弦排列勾勒其包络；13 条弦产生 78 个不同交点位置。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/cases/carbonLattices.ts:100
msgid "The sheet has 24 atoms, 30 bonds, and 7 hexagonal faces; each of the 12 inner sites with three neighbors produces 3 pairs, and each of the 12 edge sites with two neighbors produces 1 pair, totaling 48 pairs at 24 positions. There are no interior crossings or overlaps. The vertical direction approximates √3/2 by 433/500, and intersections are computed exactly for these rational inputs."
msgstr "片层有 24 个原子、30 条键和 7 个六边形面；12 个内侧三邻接点各产生 3 对，12 个二邻接边缘点各产生 1 对，共 48 对、24 处。没有内部穿越或重叠。纵向使用 433/500 近似 √3/2，求交对这些有理输入精确计算。"

